# The same screen in a light theme: hackney draws with the terminal's colours.
Set Width 1600
Set Height 900
Set Theme "Catppuccin Latte"
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Padding 24
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Hide
Type "export PS1=; clear" Enter
Show
Type "hackney" Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Screenshot light.png
Type "q"
